<title>UK: Sweden adds 300 million Sfr to 10-year bond.</title>
<headline>Sweden adds 300 million Sfr to 10-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager CS First Boston.</p>
<p> BORROWER   SWEDEN</p>
<p> AMT ** 500 MLN SFR   COUPON     4.0	 MATURITY    31.JAN.07</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.70    PAY DATE  * 21.FEB.97</p>
<p> NOTES   ** ORIGINALLY LAUNCHED FOR 200 MLN SFR ON 10.DEC.96</p>
<p>	    * PLUS 21 DAYS ACCRUED INTEREST</p>
<p> MOODY	AA3	 LISTING    EBS	 EOS	   30.JAN.97</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AA+	 DENOMS (K) FIVE	NEG PLG     YES</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
